\id DEU Are portions [mwc] -Papua New Guinea (DBL 2017) 
\h Kairuwaina Bairuwaina 
\toc1 DEUTERONOMY Kairuwaina Bairuwaina 
\toc2 Kairuwaina Bairuwaina 
\mt1 DEUTERONOMY  
\mt2 Kairuwaina Bairuwaina  
\is1 Wonaberena  
\ip Niko buka si kirumi kamonai, Israel biyisi muri yai sita riu ku Canaan kupurina ba iti karisi yai. Moses kega yabata sita nae kona kairavina wai, kairuwana e wonewone meyisi.  
\ip Greek asi gamoai niko kiruma basuna Kairuwana bairuwaina kairavina Moses mara bairuwaina God ana kairuwana pipiya e wonewonisi.  
\c 4  
\s1 Moses Bosisira i Kaokikisi  
\p
\v 1 Damanina ba Moses Israel biyisi kurisi i wona, “Kairuwana ereonowana ani beyebeyimi wai ko bosisirana wai kona mana ba kona riu ami kupura \nd Bada\nd* ami God e bereberimi wai kona yauni ba ini karimi yai.  
\v 2 Kega nikosi kaotunetune tepanai sisiya kona tubotaini kona kesana kona botaveyei. Saba \nd Bada\nd* ami God ana kaotunetune a bereberimi wai ko bokikisi.\x * \xo 4:2 \xt Revelation 22:18,19\x*   
\b  
\p
\v 6 Ko bosisirana kabitamnisi kata dam mutusi parimi ai ami nuwasuya ba kuira sina kitai. Ba nikosi kaotunetune sina nonora ba sina wona, ‘Bisuwona, niko dam kaikapona, wai pipiyisi nuwanuwasuyisi ba kuikuirisi!’  
\v 7 Kega dam kesana kaikapona asi god e gwabigwabisi nanakasike bage kota ata \nd Bada\nd* God maranai ta raupari kurina wai gwabiti ai e mamana.  
\v 8 Nikosi kairuwana karaku a wonewonim wai totorisi ba gaire sakiyisi. Kega meo dam kesana kaikapona ana kairuwana totorisi ba gaire sakiyisi bage niko kairuwana karaku a bereberimi wai rutainina.   
\b  
\p
\v 32-34 Maranai \nd Bada\nd* ami God Egypt yai ana maragata kaikaponai i uraba kasibauwimi, kiyakiyaya ba wose kaikaposi i wose. Ba komi kairavimi Egypt i abiyisi ba paiwara kaikapona i berisi. I wosimi ikesina mom ana pipiya, ba Sainai koyanai keyama kai karakarasina basunai ko nonori i sisiya kurimi ba katai yawayawasimi ko mamana. Nikasike wose kainaona i tupuwa kona kega? Kega! Ko nuwasuya e veramaga God pipiya dobuai i wosisi maranai, dobu ereonowana ko kinani. Kega god kesana nikasike wose i wose.   
\b  
\p
\v 39 Kata \nd Bada\nd* kona sapama kaidamonai ba dobu gaburinai kana God, ba kega memena kesana kotoi. Kona kairavina karaku ke nosi ba nuwanuwami yai e mana.  
\v 40 Ba nikosi kairuwana ba kaotunetune karaku a bereberimi wai ko bokikisi kata komi ba natunatumi sina tupuwa wai gairenai wata ba \nd Bada\nd* ami God kupura e bereberimi wai kona mamanei yepo ami mara ku damona.”   
\c 6  
\s1 Bada ami God koni Nuwayuyauni  
\p
\v 4 “Ko nonora, Israel biyimi! \nd Bada\nd* ata God kona \nd Bada\nd* kesana.\x * \xo 6:4 \xt Mark 12:29\x*  
\v 5  \nd Bada\nd* ami God koi nuwayauyauni, nuwanuwami tupanai, pipiyimi tupanai ba ami maragata tupanai.\x * \xo 6:5 \xt Matthew 22:37; Mark 12:30; Luke 10:27\x*  
\v 6 Nikosi kairuwana karaku a bereberimi wai nuwanuwami yai sina mana.  
\v 7 Natunatumi koi beyena tupetupenisi. Yove yai kona mamana wai koi sisiyei, ba ketai kona yewoyewo wai, ba kona kenokira ba kona bomsiri maranai wai koi sisiyei.”\x * \xo 6:7 \xt Deuteronomy 11:18-20\x*   
\c 7  
\s1 \nd Bada\nd* ana Pipiya  
\p
\v 1 “Maranai \nd Bada\nd* ami God ina urabaimi kona riu ba niko kupura kona yauni wai dam pesarisi naomi yai ina kwabisi sina kasibau. Kosi Hitti biyisi, Girgashi, Amori, Canaan, Perizi, Hivi ba Jebusi biyisi, dam asi 7 si rakata saki ba si maragata saki kega bage komi.\x * \xo 7:1 \xt Acts 13:19\x*  
\v 2 Ba maranai \nd Bada\nd* ami God ku yaromi ina terisi ba kona gebinubaisi wai koni subikakabisi, kega kesana kona boterei. Kega koni turaturanisi ba kega koni nuwanuwanisi.  
\v 3 Kega kosi pipiyisi yabata kona tabine. Kega natunatumi bibaine kona kaotaveyisi natunatusi sebasebare yabata sina tabine, kona natunatumi sebasebare kona kaotaveyisi natunatusi bibaine yabata sina tabine,  
\v 4 muri yai ba natunatumi sebasebare sini nuwatainisi ba god mutusi sina bopepetisi wai, \nd Bada\nd* yana ina borabora saki wai yagiyaginai wata ina kasibigoyonimi.  
\v 5 Nikasike kurisi kona wosei. Asi raunabonabo koi kasi rikeyana ba, asi akima bobokuwayisi koi kasigaoworana, ba Asherah ana ariri koi tara kotobana ba asi tarabibisaka keyama karakarasinai ko kapuna.  
\v 6 Kairavina \nd Bada\nd* ami God kurina wai komi pipiya kaobaisiyemi. Dobu tompipininai pipiya ereonowasi kamosi yai, \nd Bada\nd* ami God i bineimi kata komi ana pipiya ba ana sawara monimonikina.\x * \xo 7:6 \xt Exodus 19:5; Titus 2:14; 1 Peter 2:9\x*   
\p
\v 7  \nd Bada\nd* i wainimi ba i bineimi ba kega ko pesara kairavina, komi wai ami koroto i yogiyogi saki kega bage dam mutusi  
\v 8  \nd Bada\nd* i nuwayauyaunimi ba ana kaobiyoyobana maragasina kairavina i wosei.  
\v 9 Kona kuiri kata \nd Bada\nd* ami God, kona God. Kona God bipatutu biyina awaika i wonei wai e wosewosei ba nuwayauyauna bidamanina maragasina e botawani kimta thousand kurisi iyabosi te binuwayauyauni ba ana kaotunetune te botawani.  
\v 10 Saba iyabosi te bisinikikiyei wai yagiyagina wata saroba ina berisi ba ina kasibigoyonisi.\x * \xo 7:10 \xt Exodus 20:5,6, 34:6,7\x*  
\v 11 Kona kairavina ko kinani kata nikosi kaotunetune, biyoyobana ba kairuwana, karaku a berebereim wai ko kibi kabitam.”   
\c 8  
\s1 Bada Kega koi Notawapei  
\p
\v 1 “Ko pota kabitamni kata nikosi kaotunetune ereonowasi karaku a bereberimi wai kona kibi kata kona mana, ba koni tuwa pesara, ba kona riu ba \nd Bada\nd* nosinosimi kurisi i kaobiyoyobana wai kupurina kona yauni ba ini karimi yai.  
\v 2 Ko nosi, mekabage \nd Bada\nd* ami God bodu 40 i naovimi kupura momna kamonai kata ita terimi koi moyaka meyimi ba i rurubaimi kata ita kuiri awaika nuwanuwami yai ba yebo ana kaotunetune kota bosisirana kona kega.  
\v 3 I wosimi koi moyaka ba soya ko rabobo saba manna i kanikanimi, saba niko kam wai, komi ba wawami yabata kega ko kuiri. Nikona i wosei wai i bibeyimi kata pipiya kega kam wata sina kani ba sina mana, saba wona ereonowana \nd Bada\nd* kawanai e kasikasibau wai, konai tana mana.\x * \xo 8:3 \xt Matthew 4:4; Luke 4:4\x*   
\b  
\p
\v 12 Ba saba maranai ko kamkam siyabagi wai, yove yawayawana ko bowabowa ba ko mabinubaimi,  
\v 13 ba ami cow ba sheep asi koroto te rakarakata ba, ami silver ba gold te pesapesara ba ami sawara ereonowasi te pesapesara saki,  
\v 14 ko kinani kata kega kona netagegeyim, ba \nd Bada\nd* ami God kuni notawapei, Egypt kupurinai patuma kamonai i urabakasibauwimi.  
\v 15 Kairavinai naovimi nao kupura momna kaikapona ba aba naganagarina, okowina kega, ba memei mota bikokonisi ba rido yabata, ba akima padapadana kamonai okowa kairavimi i wosei i kasibau.  
\v 16 Ba kupura mominai manna tutunumi si buruburuwei wai i kanimi ba i wosimi koi moyaka kata i rurubaimi mara murinai komi ami gairena kairavina.  
\v 17 Abisiri yai kuna wona, ‘Yauku ikesiku au maragatai ba au sini nubanubai ba yaroku ai niko mariya a panani.’  
\v 18 Saba \nd Bada\nd* ami God ko nosi, kairavina kona maragata i berimi wai ko mariya, ba ana bidamanina maragasina nosinosimi yabata kurisi i wosei wai i bokikisi yepo i botu karaku.   
\b  
\p
\v 19 Abisiri yai \nd Bada\nd* ami God koni nota gugei ba god mutusi koni saunurisi, ba kona bopepetisi ba kona rudune kurisi wai karaukarau ana kaorumatanimi ba ana kasibigoyonimi.  
\v 20 Kata dam mutusi naomi yai \nd Bada\nd* i kasibigoyonisi wai, komi \nd Bada\nd* ami God kega kona bosisirei wai nanakasike ina kasibigoyonimi.”   
\b  
\c 11  
\p
\v 18 “Nikosi au wona nuwanuwami yai ba ami nota ai tema kabitam, ba matakira gubana kairavina wai nimami yai ko kauta ba nao bakobakomi ai ko kote.  
\v 19 Natunatumi koi beyebeyisi, maranai yove yai kona mamana kona ketai kona yewoyewo, ba kona kenokira ba kona bomsiri wai, koi sisiyei.\x * \xo 11:19 \xt Deuteronomy 6:6-9\x*   
\b  
\p
\v 26 Karaku nina naomi yai bigairena ba kaonawa a tereterei.  
\v 27 Maranai \nd Bada\nd* ami God ana kaotunetune karaku a bereberimi kona bosisiri wai ini gairenimi.  
\v 28 Ba maranai \nd Bada\nd* ami God ana kaotunetune karaku a bereberimi ketana koni sumarei ba god mutusi kega ko kuira ba ko kibikibisi wai ina kaonawaimi.   
\b  
\p
\v 32 Ko kinana kabitamni kata nikosi bai yoyobana ba kairuwana karaku a berebererimi wai ereonowasi ko bosisirana.”   
\s1 Taupauma Bineina  
\c 17  
\s1 Mekabage Taupauma sita Binei  
\p
\v 14 “Maranai kona riu kupura \nd Bada\nd* ami God e bereberimi wai kona yauni ini karimi yai, ba kona mabinubaimi, ba kona wona, ‘Ko kinani kata taupauma kesana tana terei ina potaita nikosi dam si mabisubibirita wai rutainisi.’\x * \xo 17:14 \xt 1 Samuel 8:5\x*  
\v 15 Ko kita kabitamni kata taupauma kona binei wai \nd Bada\nd* ami God ana binebinena, komi waresimi kesana kamomi yai kona binei. Ba kega pipiya tumana kotoi kega Israel biyina kona binei ina potaimi.  
\v 16 Ba taupauma wai kega ikesina kairavina horse pesarisi ina yauna, ba kega pipiya ina wosisi sina veramaga ku Egypt yebo mutusi sina gimona,\x * \xo 17:16 \xt 1 Kings 10:28\x* kairavina \nd Bada\nd* i wona, ‘Komi kega nao ku kupura kona veramaga mena.’  
\v 17 Kona kega kaokaowana pesarisi ina yauna muri yai ba nuwanuwana BADA karinai sina taina sirei,\x * \xo 17:17 \xt 1 Kings 11:1-8\x* kona kega mariya ini sasaranei, ba silver ba gold ina yauna saki.\x * \xo 17:17 \xt 1 Kings 10:14-22,27\x*   
\p
\v 18 Maranai taupauma asi aba makimakirai ina makira wai, ikesina kairavina niko kaotunetune tupana Livai biyisi kairuwana pepana sina berei wai ina kirumi.  
\v 19 Ba gwabinai ina botawani ba kao patepatena ana yawasa kamonai ina baibaiyavi kata \nd Bada\nd* ana God ina kuira kabitamni ba ina bokuwayei ba ana kairuwana sisiyisi ina kibi kabitamni.  
\v 20 Ba kega ina nota meyei kata kona wai i gaire saki kega turaturana mutusi rutainisi ba \nd Bada\nd* ana kairuwana ini kawapatei ba ana wainai wata ina nae. Kata kona ba ana rakara murinai te botubotu wai Israel kamonai asi bi taupauma marana ina veoroma.”   
\c 18  
\s1 Dudura Goyogoyosi  
\p
\v 9 “Maranai kona riu kupura ami God e bereberimi wai, kega dam namai te mamana wai asi yawasa pudapudasi ba goyo tavetaveyisi koni boneboneisi.  
\v 10 Kega kesana kamomi yai sina panani natuna sebare kona wasike raunabonabo tepanai keyama karakarasinai ina puyobunuwa, ini kairapu,\x * \xo 18:10 \xt Exodus 22:18\x* ina yapune, ini kwerikweri, kona ini muwara,  
\v 11 kona te kawakawa kairapu ba raoboraobosi kanumisi te yoreyoeyore geyisi ba yoveyovesi ba banebanesi.  
\v 12 Kotoi wata nikosi wose pudapudasi ina wose wai \nd Bada\nd* kurina wai; si goyo saki. Ba nikosi wose goyogoyosi kairavina \nd Bada\nd* ami God naomi yai dam ina kwabinisi sina kasibau.  
\v 13 Komi \nd Bada\nd* ami God matanai kega awaika kunumakina kona yauni.”\x * \xo 18:13 \xt Matthew 5:48\x*   
\s1 Peroveta Moses Rutainina  
\p
\v 15 “Ba komi kairavimi wai \nd Bada\nd* ami God peroveta yauku rutainiku. Warewaresimi kesana kamomi yai ina yorei ba kona, ana sisiya kona nonori.\x * \xo 18:15 \xt Acts 3:22, 7:37\x*  
\v 16 Ba Sainai koyanai koi kesanimi wai \nd Bada\nd* ami God koi babai maranai ko wona kata, ‘Kega \nd Bada\nd* ata God gamona tana nonori kona niko keyama karakarasina tana kinana meyei, muri yai ba tana rabobo.’   
\p
\v 17 Ba \nd Bada\nd* kuriku i wona, ‘Awaika si sisiyei wai i gaire.  
\v 18 Yauku peroveta kesana Israel biyisi waresisi kamosi yai kom rutainim ana yorei, ba kawanai wonaku a kaotunei wai ereonowana pipiya ina wonisi.  
\v 19 Ba kotoi wata wonaku niko peroveta kau wabai ini biyoneyonei ba kega ina nonora wai yauku ikesiku mom saroba ana berei.\x * \xo 18:19 \xt Acts 3:23\x*  
\v 20 Saba meo peroveta kega sisiya a wonei ba kau wabai e bisisiya, kona god mutusi kasi wabai e bisisiya wai ko kasibunui.’   
\p
\v 21 Saba memena bage kona wona, ‘Mekabage kana kuiri kata wara kega \nd Bada\nd* i porai?’  
\v 22 Maranai peroveta \nd Bada\nd* kana wabai e biyonayona ba wosena kega ina tupuwa wai, kona kuiri kata kona warana wai kega \nd Bada\nd* i sisiya. Nao peroveta wai ikesina ana sisiya ba kega kona nagarei.”   
\c 31  
\s1 Joshua Israel i Badei  
\p
\v 7 Damanina ba Moses, Israel biyisi matasi yai Joshua i yorei ba i wonei, “Ki maragata ba ki tepatora. Kairavina kom nikosi pipiya yabata kona nae \nd Bada\nd* nosinosisi kupura i kaobiyoyobana ita berisi wai nakai kona riu. Kom mom kupurina kamonai kuni yapara owaowa ba tanona kamosi yai kom kuni kodei kata asi buderi.  
\v 8 Ba \nd Bada\nd* ikesina ini naovim ba ina potaim kega ini sumarimi kona ina tere bigaruimi\x * \xo 31:8 \xt Joshua 1:5; Hebrews 13:5\x* ba kega kuna nagara, kona am nota ina peku.”   
\c 34  
\s1 Moses i Rabobo  
\p
\v 1 Damanina ba Moses Moab guburinai wata i gae ku, Nebo koyana i gaeni ku Pisgah tepana Jericho sepinai. Ba \nd Bada\nd* kupurina tupana Gilead yai ba i nae ku Dan wai ereonowana i beyei,  
\v 2 yebo i nae ku Naphtali ba Ephraim ba Manasseh kupurisi. Ba Judah kupurinai ba i kabari i nae ku Mediterranean Enagina.  
\v 3 Ba ku Negev kupura momna ba Jericho ku kawa sanagina ba ku Palm meyagina ba i nae Zoar parasina.  
\v 4 Damanina ba \nd Bada\nd*, kurina i wona, “Niko kupura ikesiku mom au kaobiyoyobana maragasina a wosei, Abraham, Isaac ba Jacob kurisi, ba a wona, ‘Am rakaraka ana bereisi.’\x * \xo 34:4 \xt Genesis 12:7, 26:3, 28:13\x* Ai beyim matami yai ku kitai saba kom kega kuni garubona nakai.”   
\b  
\p
\v 5 Kata \nd Bada\nd* ana saibisaibirina Moses namai Moab kamonai i rabobo, \nd Bada\nd* i wona wai nanakasike.   
\b  
\p
\v 9 Kata Nun natuna sebare Joshua, nuwasuya kanumina i bonuwei kairavina Moses yarona gayamina tepanai i terei. Ba Israel biyisi si tainabaenega kurina, mekabage \nd Bada\nd*, Moses i kaotunei wai nanakasike si wosei.   